Package: dev.playday3008.lowerinstall
Name: LowerInstall
Version: 1.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 5.0)
Conflicts: com.julioverne.lowerinstall
Description: Install apps requiring a newer iOS version on older devices. Hooks installd to skip device-family/thinning/metadata checks and spoofs the App Store User-Agent so metadata servers return IPAs for a spoofed OS version. Supports iOS 5.0+. Inspired by julioverne/LowerInstall.
Maintainer: PlayDay <18056374+playday3008@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: PlayDay
Section: Tweaks
